    "detailed_description": "<strong>RISE UP </strong><br><br>The village is under threat as monsters begin to emerge from the forest. Only you, Ninjabun can stop them! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958640/extras/86de094fdb47507862b06dc67db3b97a.poster.avif?t=1742930144\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958640/extras/86de094fdb47507862b06dc67db3b97a.webm?t=1742930144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958640/extras/86de094fdb47507862b06dc67db3b97a.mp4?t=1742930144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This top-down action Roguelite is inspired by the classics will take you on a thrilling adventure where your skills and determination will be tested! Hack, Slash, Dodge and Dash your way through endless enemies to protect your village and go for the high score! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958640/extras/7b12180961883d040f261ec5e3d973dd.poster.avif?t=1742930144\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958640/extras/7b12180961883d040f261ec5e3d973dd.webm?t=1742930144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958640/extras/7b12180961883d040f261ec5e3d973dd.mp4?t=1742930144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Seek the help of villagers to aid you on your quest! Out in the forest, find ninja scrolls to obtain the power to vanquish your enemy!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958640/extras/619fc1ca4303332dbf3fc1f6b9c2db03.poster.avif?t=1742930144\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958640/extras/619fc1ca4303332dbf3fc1f6b9c2db03.webm?t=1742930144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958640/extras/619fc1ca4303332dbf3fc1f6b9c2db03.mp4?t=1742930144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>RISE UP </strong><br><br>The village is under threat as monsters begin to emerge from the forest. Only you, Ninjabun can stop them! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958640/extras/86de094fdb47507862b06dc67db3b97a.poster.avif?t=1742930144\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958640/extras/86de094fdb47507862b06dc67db3b97a.webm?t=1742930144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958640/extras/86de094fdb47507862b06dc67db3b97a.mp4?t=1742930144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This top-down action Roguelite is inspired by the classics will take you on a thrilling adventure where your skills and determination will be tested! Hack, Slash, Dodge and Dash your way through endless enemies to protect your village and go for the high score! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958640/extras/7b12180961883d040f261ec5e3d973dd.poster.avif?t=1742930144\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958640/extras/7b12180961883d040f261ec5e3d973dd.webm?t=1742930144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958640/extras/7b12180961883d040f261ec5e3d973dd.mp4?t=1742930144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Seek the help of villagers to aid you on your quest! Out in the forest, find ninja scrolls to obtain the power to vanquish your enemy!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958640/extras/619fc1ca4303332dbf3fc1f6b9c2db03.poster.avif?t=1742930144\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958640/extras/619fc1ca4303332dbf3fc1f6b9c2db03.webm?t=1742930144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958640/extras/619fc1ca4303332dbf3fc1f6b9c2db03.mp4?t=1742930144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
